<section class="heritage">
  <div class="heritage-text">
    <div class="hero-subtitle">Our Heritage</div>
    <h2>Swiss Watches Since 1853</h2>
    <p>TISSOT has been pioneering craftsmanship and innovation since its foundation in Le Locle, in the Swiss Jura mountains. Our commitment to creating accessible luxury has made us a leader in the traditional Swiss watch industry.</p>
